      "parameters": {
        "width": 460,
        "height": 620,
        "content": "## Analyze customer feedback sentiment with OpenAI, log to Google Sheets and alert Slack on negative reviews\n\n### Who's it for\nSupport, product and customer-success teams that collect feedback from forms, surveys or apps.\n\n### How it works\n1. A Webhook receives feedback as JSON: {\"customer\": \"...\", \"feedback\": \"...\"}\n2. OpenAI (gpt-4o-mini) returns sentiment, a -1..1 score, topics and a suggested action\n3. Every result is appended to a Google Sheet\n4. Negative feedback posts an alert to a Slack channel\n\n### How to set up\n- Add OpenAI, Google Sheets and Slack credentials\n- Paste your Sheet URL into 'Log Feedback' (header row: customer, text, sentiment, score, topics, suggested_action)\n- Set your Slack channel in 'Alert Slack'\n- Point your form/survey tool at the Production webhook URL and activate\n\n### Requirements\nOpenAI API key, Google account, Slack workspace\n\n### How to customize\nChange the model or prompt in 'Analyze Sentiment', or alert on score < -0.5 instead of the label.\n\nMore ready-made business workflows: [n8n Small-Business Automation Pack](https://penkala6.gumroad.com/l/nuzbv)"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
